    `Certificate ${esc(f.certNo||'without number')}${f.standard?' to '+esc(f.standard):''}${f.issuer?', issued by '+esc(f.issuer):''}${f.issueDate?' on '+f.issueDate:''}, for ${esc(who)}. Employer stated on the certificate: ${esc(f.employer||'not stated')}.${f.designation?' Designation: '+esc(f.designation)+'.':''}`);
